      "text": "Hyderabad State was established in 1724 by Nizam-ul-Mulk, Asaf Jah I, who was appointed as the viceroy of the Deccan by the Mughal emperor. He declared independence from the Mughal Empire and founded the Asaf Jahi dynasty.",
