      "text": "The tomb, known as KV62, was originally constructed as a non-royal tomb before being adapted for Tutankhamun's burial after his premature death. The exact date of construction is unknown, but it would have been during the Eighteenth Dynasty of ancient Egypt.",
      "date": "-01330"
