      "text": "In 476 CE, the fall of the Western Roman Empire led to the rise of the Frankish kingdoms in the region that is now France.",
      "date": "0476"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Reign of Clovis I",
      "text": "Clovis I, the first King of the Franks, reigned from 481 to 511 CE and united most of the Frankish tribes under one ruler.",
      "date": "0481"
    },
