      "headline": "RS-232-C Revision",
      "text": "In 1969, the RS-232-C revision was released. This version included more detailed specifications and became widely adopted in the industry, solidifying RS-232's role in serial communication.",
      "date": "1969"
    },
    {
      "headline": "RS-232-D Revision",
      "text": "The RS-232-D revision was introduced in 1987, which included further refinements and updates to the standard to keep pace with technological advancements.",
      "date": "1987"
    },
