      "headline": "Current Version: TIA-232-F",
      "text": "The current version of the RS-232 standard, known as TIA-232-F, was issued in 1997. This version is titled 'Interface Between Data Terminal Equipment and Data Circuit-Terminating Equipment Employing Serial Binary Data Interchange' and includes the latest updates and specifications.",
      "date": "1997"
    }
  ]
}

