      "headline": "Operation Barbarossa",
      "text": "On June 22, 1941, the German Army launched Operation Barbarossa, the invasion of the Soviet Union, which was the largest military operation in history in terms of manpower and casualties.",
      "date": "1941-06-22"
    },
