      "date": "1676-12-14"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Great Turkish War",
      "text": "Leopold I played a significant role in the Great Turkish War (1683–1699), which included the famous Battle of Vienna in 1683, where the Ottoman Empire was decisively defeated.",
      "date": "1683"
