      "headline": "Emergence of CDNs",
      "text": "Content Delivery Networks (CDNs) emerged in the late 1990s as a solution to alleviate performance bottlenecks of the Internet. This was a response to the growing importance of the Internet as a mission-critical medium for people and enterprises.",
      "date": "1990"
