      "headline": "Establishment of the National Health Service",
      "text": "The National Health Service (NHS) was established on July 5, 1948, as part of major social reforms following the Second World War. It was founded on the principles that services should be comprehensive, universal, and free at the point of delivery.",
      "date": "1948-07-05"
