      "headline": "Annexation of Crimea",
      "text": "In 2014, following the annexation of Crimea by Russia, the Ukrainian Ground Forces were involved in the conflict in Eastern Ukraine, marking a significant escalation in their operational activities.",
      "date": "2014"
