      "text": "Haji Bektash Veli, the founder of the Bektashi Order, passed away in 1271. His teachings and legacy continued to influence the order.",
      "date": "1271"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Bektashi Order in the Ottoman Empire",
      "text": "During the 16th century, the Bektashi Order became widespread in the Ottoman Empire, gaining significant influence and followers.",
