    {
      "headline": "Suppression of the Bektashi Order",
      "text": "In 1826, the Bektashi Order was suppressed by Sultan Mahmud II as part of his efforts to dismantle the Janissary corps, which were closely associated with the Bektashis.",
      "date": "1826"
