      "text": "Scheduled for November 2021, Artemis I is the first integrated flight test of NASA's Space Launch System (SLS) rocket and the Orion spacecraft, aiming to demonstrate the performance of the spacecraft in a lunar orbit.",
      "date": "2021-11"
