      "headline": "Birth of Lü Bu",
      "text": "Lü Bu was born in Jiuyuan County, Wuyuan Commandery, which is present-day Baotou, Inner Mongolia. The exact year of his birth is not recorded, but it is estimated to be around 160.",
      "date": "0160"
    },
