      "headline": "Beginning of the Colombian Conflict",
      "text": "The Colombian conflict began on May 27, 1964, as a low-intensity asymmetric war involving the government of Colombia, far-right paramilitary groups, crime syndicates, and far-left guerrilla groups.",
      "date": "1964-05-27"
    },
