      "text": "The Hyksos, a group of mixed Semitic-Asiatic origin, began to rule over parts of Egypt, establishing the Fifteenth Dynasty. They set up their capital at Avaris in the Nile Delta. This period marks the beginning of their influence over Lower and Middle Egypt.",
