      "text": "The Hyksos period saw the introduction of new cultural elements, including the worship of foreign deities such as Baal, which were integrated into the Egyptian pantheon.",
      "date": "-1650"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Hyksos Rule Ends",
      "text": "The Hyksos rule came to an end around 1550 BCE when Ahmose I, the founder of the Eighteenth Dynasty, successfully expelled them from Egypt, marking the beginning of the New Kingdom.",
      "date": "-1550"
    }
  ]
}

