      "headline": "Establishment of the University of Oxford",
      "text": "The University of Oxford, one of the oldest universities in the world, was established in Oxfordshire. The exact date is unknown, but teaching existed in some form in 1096.",
      "date": "1096"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Opening of Blenheim Palace",
      "text": "Blenheim Palace, located in Woodstock, Oxfordshire, was completed in 1722. It was built as a gift to John Churchill, 1st Duke of Marlborough, for his military victories.",
      "date": "1722"
    },
