      "headline": "Publication of De revolutionibus orbium coelestium",
      "text": "In 1543, Nicolaus Copernicus published De revolutionibus orbium coelestium, which proposed a heliocentric model of the universe, marking the beginning of the Scientific Revolution.",
      "date": "1543"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Andreas Vesalius publishes De humani corporis fabrica",
