      "headline": "Introduction of the B-2 Spirit",
      "text": "The United States introduced the B-2 Spirit, a stealth bomber capable of penetrating dense anti-aircraft defenses, representing a significant advancement in strategic bombing technology.",
      "date": "1997"
    },
    {
      "headline": "China's H-6 Bomber",
      "text": "China developed the H-6 bomber, based on the Soviet Tu-16, which has been modernized over the years to enhance its strategic bombing capabilities.",
      "date": "1990s"
    },
