      "headline": "Patronage of the Arts",
      "text": "Throughout his life, Cosimo was a significant patron of the arts, funding projects such as Donatello's David, and supporting artists like Brunelleschi and Fra Angelico.",
      "date": "1430s-1460s"
    },
