      "headline": "Discovery of Erythromycin",
      "text": "Erythromycin was discovered in 1952 by Filipino scientist Abelardo Aguilar. The antibiotic was derived from the bacterium Saccharopolyspora erythraea, which was found in a soil sample from the Philippines.",
      "date": "1952"
