      "text": "On February 24, 1986, the body of Sherri Rasmussen was found in the apartment she shared with her husband, John Ruetten, in the Van Nuys neighborhood of Los Angeles, California. She had been beaten and shot three times in a struggle.",
      "date": "1986-02-24"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Initial Investigation",
      "text": "Following the discovery of Sherri Rasmussen's body, the Los Angeles Police Department (LAPD) initially considered the case a botched burglary and were unable to identify a suspect.",
