      "headline": "Uthmanic Codex",
      "text": "During the caliphate of Uthman (644-656 CE), the Quran was standardized into a single text to prevent variations, leading to the creation of the Uthmanic Codex.",
      "date": "0650"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Spread of the Uthmanic Codex",
      "text": "Copies of the Uthmanic Codex were sent to various Islamic regions to ensure uniformity in the Quranic text.",
      "date": "0650"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Development of Quranic Sciences",
      "text": "Over the centuries, various sciences related to the Quran, such as Tafsir (exegesis) and Tajwid (recitation), developed to aid in its understanding and preservation.",
      "date": "0700"
    },
    {
