      "text": "Dianetics was first introduced to the public with the publication of L. Ron Hubbard's book 'Dianetics: The Modern Science of Mental Health' on May 9, 1950. The book outlined the principles of Dianetics and proposed a new approach to mental health.",
      "date": "1950-05-09"
