      "headline": "Founding of the Hubbard Dianetic Research Foundation",
      "text": "In August 1950, L. Ron Hubbard established the Hubbard Dianetic Research Foundation in Elizabeth, New Jersey, to promote and further develop the principles of Dianetics.",
