      "headline": "Early Development of the Harpsichord",
      "text": "The earliest known reference to a harpsichord dates back to the 14th century. The instrument evolved from earlier stringed keyboard instruments like the psaltery.",
      "date": "1300"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Known Harpsichord Makers",
      "text": "The first known harpsichord makers were active in the 15th century, with the earliest surviving harpsichords dating from this period.",
