      "text": "The development of the Tor missile system began in the late 1970s by the Soviet Union. It was designed to provide a mobile, all-weather, low-to-medium-altitude, short-range air defense system capable of engaging aircraft, helicopters, cruise missiles, and unmanned aerial vehicles.",
