    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'Fair Warning'",
      "text": "On April 29, 1981, Van Halen released their fourth studio album, 'Fair Warning'. The album is noted for its darker tone and complex musical arrangements.",
      "date": "1981-04-29"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'Diver Down'",
      "text": "The band released 'Diver Down', their fifth studio album, on April 14, 1982. It included several cover songs and became another commercial success.",
