      "text": "Van Halen released their seventh studio album, '5150', on March 24, 1986, with new lead singer Sammy Hagar. The album marked a new era for the band and was a commercial success.",
      "date": "1986-03-24"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'OU812'",
      "text": "On May 24, 1988, Van Halen released their eighth studio album, 'OU812'. The album continued the band's success with Sammy Hagar as lead vocalist.",
