    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'For Unlawful Carnal Knowledge'",
      "text": "Van Halen released their ninth studio album, 'For Unlawful Carnal Knowledge', on June 17, 1991. The album won a Grammy Award for Best Hard Rock Performance.",
