      "date": "1993-02-23"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'Balance'",
      "text": "Van Halen released their tenth studio album, 'Balance', on January 24, 1995. It was the last studio album to feature Sammy Hagar as lead vocalist.",
      "date": "1995-01-24"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Sammy Hagar Leaves Van Halen",
      "text": "In 1996, Sammy Hagar left Van Halen, leading to a period of instability in the band's lineup.",
      "date": "1996"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'Van Halen III'",
      "text": "Van Halen released their eleventh studio album, 'Van Halen III', on March 17, 1998, with new lead singer Gary Cherone.",
