      "headline": "World War II Advancements",
      "text": "Sonar technology saw significant advancements during World War II, with improvements in range, accuracy, and reliability.",
      "date": "1939"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Post-War Sonar Applications",
      "text": "After World War II, sonar technology was adapted for civilian use, including in fishing, oceanography, and navigation.",
      "date": "1945"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Development of Side-scan Sonar",
      "text": "In the 1950s, side-scan sonar was developed, allowing for detailed imaging of the sea floor.",
      "date": "1950"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Modern Sonar Technology",
      "text": "Today, sonar technology is used in a wide range of applications, from military to scientific research, and continues to evolve with advancements in digital technology.",
      "date": "2023"
    }
  ]
}

