      "text": "On 1979-09-22, an unidentified double flash of light was detected by an American Vela Hotel satellite near the South African territory of Prince Edward Islands in the Indian Ocean. This event is widely believed to have been caused by a nuclear explosion, possibly an undeclared joint nuclear test by South Africa and Israel.",
