      "headline": "Birth of Albert Hofmann",
      "text": "Albert Hofmann was born on January 11, 1906, in Baden, Switzerland.",
      "date": "1906-01-11"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Synthesis of LSD",
      "text": "In 1938, Albert Hofmann first synthesized lysergic acid diethylamide (LSD) at the Sandoz Laboratories in Basel, Switzerland.",
