      "headline": "Part of the Theban Plays",
      "text": "'Antigone' is part of the three Theban plays by Sophocles, which include 'Oedipus Rex' and 'Oedipus at Colonus'. Although 'Antigone' was written first, it is the last in the chronological order of events depicted in the plays.",
