      "text": "In 1938, King Carol II of Romania initiated a crackdown on the Iron Guard, leading to the arrest and execution of its leader, Corneliu Zelea Codreanu.",
      "date": "1938"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Rise to Power",
      "text": "In September 1940, the Iron Guard came to power as part of a coalition government with General Ion Antonescu, forming the National Legionary State.",
      "date": "1940-09"
