      "headline": "Legionnaires' Rebellion and Pogrom",
      "text": "In January 1941, the Iron Guard attempted a coup against Ion Antonescu, leading to the Legionnaires' Rebellion and the Bucharest Pogrom, which resulted in the deaths of many Jews.",
      "date": "1941-01"
    },
