      "headline": "Yeltsin Dissolves Parliament",
      "text": "On September 21, 1993, Russian President Boris Yeltsin issued a decree dissolving the country's parliament, the Supreme Soviet, and the Congress of People's Deputies, citing the need to implement economic reforms.",
      "date": "1993-09-21"
    },
