      "text": "In 1938, Schmitt published 'The Leviathan in the State Theory of Thomas Hobbes', analyzing Hobbes's work in the context of his own political theories.",
      "date": "1938"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Post-War Detention",
      "text": "After World War II, Schmitt was detained by American forces in 1945 but was released without charges in 1946.",
