      "text": "The Blackfoot Confederacy, also known as Niitsitapi or Siksikaitsitapi, was formed as a collective of linguistically related groups, including the Siksika, Kainai, and Piikani. The Confederacy was established to strengthen alliances and protect their territories.",
      "date": "-1700"
