      "text": "On 9 November 1799, known as 18 Brumaire, Year VIII, in the French Republican calendar, Napoleon Bonaparte led a coup d'état that overthrew the Directory, replacing it with the French Consulate. This bloodless coup brought Napoleon to power as First Consul of the French First Republic and is considered by most historians to have ended the French Revolution.",
