      "headline": "Beginning of the War in Donbas",
      "text": "In April 2014, the war in Donbas began when a commando unit led by Russian citizen Igor Girkin seized the city of Sloviansk in the Donetsk oblast of Ukraine.",
      "date": "2014-04"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Ukrainian Military Operation",
      "text": "Following the seizure of Sloviansk, the Ukrainian military launched an operation against the separatists in an attempt to regain control over the region.",
      "date": "2014-04"
    },
