      "headline": "Battle of Ilovaisk",
      "text": "In August 2014, the Battle of Ilovaisk took place, resulting in a significant defeat for Ukrainian forces and highlighting the involvement of Russian military units in the conflict.",
      "date": "2014-08"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Minsk Protocol",
      "text": "On September 5, 2014, the Minsk Protocol was signed as a ceasefire agreement between Ukraine, Russia, and the self-proclaimed republics of Donetsk and Luhansk, although it was frequently violated.",
      "date": "2014-09-05"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Second Battle of Donetsk Airport",
      "text": "The Second Battle of Donetsk Airport occurred from September 2014 to January 2015, resulting in the destruction of the airport and heavy casualties on both sides.",
      "date": "2014-09"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Minsk II Agreement",
      "text": "On February 12, 2015, the Minsk II agreement was signed to halt the fighting, but like its predecessor, it was not fully implemented.",
      "date": "2015-02-12"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Battle of Debaltseve",
      "text": "In February 2015, the Battle of Debaltseve took place, with pro-Russian forces capturing the strategic town after intense fighting.",
      "date": "2015-02"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Stalemate and Low-Intensity Conflict",
      "text": "From 2015 to 2021, the conflict settled into a stalemate with sporadic fighting and occasional escalations, causing ongoing casualties and displacement.",
      "date": "2015"
    },
