      "headline": "Escalation in 2021",
      "text": "In 2021, tensions escalated with increased military activity and troop buildups by Russia near the Ukrainian border.",
      "date": "2021"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Russian Invasion of Ukraine",
      "text": "On February 24, 2022, the conflict in Donbas was subsumed by the larger Russian invasion of Ukraine, marking a new phase in the Russo-Ukrainian War.",
      "date": "2022-02-24"
    }
  ]
}

