      "text": "The Battle of Appomattox Court House was fought on the morning of April 9, 1865, in Appomattox County, Virginia. It was one of the last battles of the American Civil War and marked the final engagement of Confederate General Robert E. Lee and his Army of Northern Virginia before their surrender.",
