      "headline": "Publication of Roman de Brut",
      "text": "In 1155, Wace, a Norman poet, completed the Roman de Brut, a verse adaptation of Geoffrey of Monmouth's Historia Regum Britanniae. This work contributed to the spread of Arthurian legends in the French-speaking world.",
      "date": "1155"
