      "headline": "Advocacy for Hibakusha",
      "text": "Throughout the 1960s and 1970s, Nihon Hidankyo actively campaigned for the recognition and support of hibakusha (atomic bomb survivors), including medical care and financial assistance.",
      "date": "1960"
    },
    {
      "headline": "International Outreach",
      "text": "In the 1980s, Nihon Hidankyo expanded its efforts internationally, participating in global peace movements and raising awareness about the effects of nuclear weapons.",
      "date": "1980"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Campaign for Nuclear Abolition",
      "text": "In the 1990s and 2000s, Nihon Hidankyo intensified its campaign for the abolition of nuclear weapons, aligning with international disarmament efforts.",
      "date": "1990"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Recognition and Awards",
