      "headline": "William Gilbert's Studies on Magnetism and Electricity",
      "text": "In 1600, William Gilbert published 'De Magnete', where he distinguished between magnetism and static electricity, coining the term 'electricus' to describe the force exerted by certain substances when rubbed.",
