      "headline": "Monterey Under Mexican Rule",
      "text": "After Mexico gained independence from Spain in 1821, Monterey continued as the capital of Alta California under Mexican rule from 1822 to 1846.",
      "date": "1822"
    },
    {
      "headline": "United States Flag Raised Over Customs House",
      "text": "During the Mexican–American War, the United States Flag was raised over the Customs House in Monterey in 1846, marking the beginning of American control.",
      "date": "1846"
