      "headline": "Bulger Goes on the Run",
      "text": "In 1994, after being tipped off about an impending indictment, Whitey Bulger fled Boston and went into hiding, becoming one of the FBI's Ten Most Wanted Fugitives.",
      "date": "1994"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Capture of Whitey Bulger",
      "text": "On June 22, 2011, Whitey Bulger was captured in Santa Monica, California, after 16 years on the run.",
      "date": "2011-06-22"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Conviction of Whitey Bulger",
      "text": "In 2013, Whitey Bulger was convicted of numerous crimes, including 11 murders, and sentenced to two consecutive life terms plus five years.",
      "date": "2013"
    },
