      "headline": "Surrender of Hiroo Onoda",
      "text": "Hiroo Onoda, another Japanese holdout, surrendered on March 9, 1974, on Lubang Island in the Philippines. He had been holding out for nearly 30 years, refusing to believe the war was over until his former commanding officer personally informed him.",
