      "headline": "Emergence of the Sex-Positive Movement",
      "text": "The sex-positive movement began to take shape in the 1960s and 1970s, during the sexual revolution. This period was marked by a significant shift in societal attitudes towards sexuality, emphasizing sexual freedom and liberation.",
      "date": "1960"
    },
