      "headline": "Influence of Feminism",
      "text": "In the 1980s, the sex-positive movement was influenced by feminist thought, particularly the debates around pornography and sexual expression. This era saw the rise of sex-positive feminism, which argued for the empowerment of women through sexual freedom.",
      "date": "1980"
    },
    {
      "headline": "AIDS Crisis and Safe Sex Advocacy",
      "text": "During the 1980s and 1990s, the sex-positive movement played a crucial role in advocating for safe sex practices in response to the AIDS crisis. This period emphasized the importance of safer sex and comprehensive sex education.",
      "date": "1980"
    },
