      "text": "The sex-positive movement has been closely aligned with the expansion of LGBTQ+ rights, advocating for the acceptance and celebration of diverse sexual orientations and gender identities.",
      "date": "1990"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Internet and Digital Age Influence",
      "text": "With the rise of the internet in the late 1990s and early 2000s, the sex-positive movement gained new platforms for discussion and advocacy, allowing for greater dissemination of sex-positive ideas and resources.",
      "date": "2000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Modern Advocacy and Education",
      "text": "In the 21st century, the sex-positive movement continues to advocate for comprehensive sex education, reproductive rights, and the normalization of diverse sexual expressions and identities.",
