      "headline": "Formation of Stone Mountain",
      "text": "Stone Mountain was formed during the formation of the Blue Ridge Mountains around 300 to 350 million years ago during the late Paleozoic era.",
      "date": "-034999999"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Recorded European Exploration",
      "text": "In 1567, Spanish explorers led by Juan Pardo were the first Europeans to explore the area around Stone Mountain.",
      "date": "1567"
