      "text": "Udaipur was founded in 1559 by Maharana Udai Singh II of the Sisodia clan of Rajputs. He established the city as the new capital of the Mewar kingdom after moving from Chittorgarh, which was under siege by the Mughal Emperor Akbar.",
      "date": "1559"
