      "headline": "Establishment of the Federal Trade Commission",
      "text": "The Federal Trade Commission (FTC) was established on September 26, 1914, with the signing of the Federal Trade Commission Act by President Woodrow Wilson. The agency was created to prevent unfair methods of competition in commerce.",
      "date": "1914-09-26"
    },
    {
