      "headline": "Fez under the Almoravid rule",
      "text": "In 1070, the Almoravids took control of Fez, unifying the two settlements on either side of the river into a single city.",
      "date": "1070"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Construction of the Great Mosque of Fez",
      "text": "The Great Mosque of Fez was constructed in 859 CE, serving as a major religious and educational center.",
      "date": "0859"
    },
    {
