      "text": "In 1145, Fez came under the control of the Almohad Caliphate, which further developed the city.",
      "date": "1145"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Fez becomes the capital of the Marinid dynasty",
      "text": "In the 13th century, Fez became the capital of the Marinid dynasty, marking a period of prosperity and architectural development.",
      "date": "1200"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Construction of the Bou Inania Madrasa",
      "text": "The Bou Inania Madrasa was constructed in 1351-1356 under the Marinid dynasty, known for its architectural beauty.",
