    },
    {
      "headline": "Studies at the Copenhagen Academy",
      "text": "In 1794, Friedrich began his studies at the Royal Danish Academy of Fine Arts in Copenhagen, where he was influenced by the work of Jens Juel and Nicolai Abildgaard.",
      "date": "1794"
