      "text": "In 1978, the first documented BASE jump was made by Carl Boenish, his wife Jean, and friends Phil Smith and Phil Mayfield from El Capitan in Yosemite National Park, California. This jump is considered the birth of modern BASE jumping.",
      "date": "1978"
