      "text": "In the late 1990s, wingsuit BASE jumping was introduced, allowing jumpers to glide through the air before deploying their parachutes, adding a new dimension to the sport.",
      "date": "1990s"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Legalization of BASE Jumping in Twin Falls, Idaho",
      "text": "In 2002, the Perrine Bridge in Twin Falls, Idaho, became one of the few legal BASE jumping sites in the United States, attracting jumpers from around the world.",
      "date": "2002"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Felix Baumgartner's Record BASE Jump",
