    {
      "headline": "Declaration of Breda",
      "text": "On April 4, 1660, Charles II issued the Declaration of Breda, outlining his conditions for accepting the throne and promising a general pardon, religious toleration, and payment of arrears to the army.",
      "date": "1660-04-04"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Convention Parliament",
      "text": "The Convention Parliament met on April 25, 1660, and was instrumental in negotiating the terms for the restoration of the monarchy.",
