      "headline": "Founding of Image Comics",
      "text": "Image Comics was founded in February 1992 by a group of high-profile illustrators, including Todd McFarlane, Jim Lee, Rob Liefeld, Erik Larsen, Whilce Portacio, Marc Silvestri, and Jim Valentino.",
