    },
    {
      "headline": "L-DOPA in Parkinson's Disease",
      "text": "In the 1960s, L-DOPA was found to be effective in treating Parkinson's disease by George Cotzias and his colleagues, marking a significant breakthrough in the treatment of the disease.",
      "date": "1960"
    },
