      "text": "In 1609, the Satsuma Domain of Japan invaded the Ryukyu Kingdom, making it a vassal state while allowing it to retain de jure independence.",
      "date": "1609"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Transformation into Ryukyu Domain",
      "text": "In 1872, the Ryukyu Kingdom was transformed into the Ryukyu Domain by the Empire of Japan, marking a shift in its political status.",
      "date": "1872"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Annexation and Dissolution",
      "text": "In 1879, the Ryukyu Kingdom was formally annexed and dissolved by Japan, becoming Okinawa Prefecture. The Ryukyuan monarchy was integrated into the new Japanese nobility.",
